# Audio / Video outputs
outputs/
artifacts/
*.wav
# Except the recording-session fixtures. Colab reaches them with `git pull`,
# and 8 MB of derived audio is worth carrying to avoid re-uploading 200 MB of
# video into every fresh runtime. The .mov sources stay ignored.
!fixtures/*.wav

# The per-sentence slices, for the same reason and on the same budget — 1.9 MB.
# This needs its own line because the pattern above does not reach into a
# subdirectory. They are his real English, so they are the Whisper content
# floor, the same-language identity ceiling, and what every generated clip is
# listened to against; a GPU session without them can report numbers but
# cannot calibrate them.
!fixtures/en_speaker/*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.aac
*.m4a
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv

